{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEKO is a Roguelike Deckbuilder where you have to reach the highest possible score by playing poker hands, but in an unconventional way: making 3 combos at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own strategies; each one offers a different way to win your runs. As you advance, you'll unlock new ways to multiply your score and get as far as possible. Manage your deck, remove cards, buy consumables, bet to win more, get bonuses for playing better, take risks, choose to save or spend it all, play with your money as you wish, fight bosses, surpass the imposed limits, and choose the strategy that best suits what appears in the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single correct way to play this. Break the game, dare to try new things. Everything you do will add to your final score.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835670?t=1754065487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835670?t=1754065487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/c8619c774569a525bbfc90e0bb0f95e278f6d04b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754065487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/c8619c774569a525bbfc90e0bb0f95e278f6d04b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754065487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEKO is a Roguelike Deckbuilder where you have to reach the highest possible score by playing poker hands, but in an unconventional way: making 3 combos at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own strategies; each one offers a different way to win your runs. As you advance, you'll unlock new ways to multiply your score and get as far as possible. Manage your deck, remove cards, buy consumables, bet to win more, get bonuses for playing better, take risks, choose to save or spend it all, play with your money as you wish, fight bosses, surpass the imposed limits, and choose the strategy that best suits what appears in the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single correct way to play this. Break the game, dare to try new things. Everything you do will add to your final score.</p>","developers":["Talio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/4109cce1ed6f25c14b8789fafbe1f2523e6c338b/header.jpg?t=1754065487","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175214,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175214/movie480.mp4?t=1754064688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175214/movie_max.mp4?t=1754064688"},"name":"TEKO Open Beta Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175214/0e768a30ab7e540eecb20d606827c0cf9cdcc9f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754064688","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175214/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754064688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175214/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754064688"}}],"name":"TEKO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Talio Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_ag